-- (7).
#ASSERT `o 22 r 2(7) the date by reference to which the priority is determined` TRUE (Date 10 1 2027) EQUALS JUST (Date 10 1 2027)
#ASSERT `o 22 r 2(7) the date by reference to which the priority is determined` FALSE (Date 10 1 2027) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 22 r 2(7) the priority is determined by reference to the date of original issue` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
